        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jaroslav Seifert, Harlan Coben, Stanislav Kostka Neumann\n- Roles: writer, poet, journalist, mentor\n- Topics: Nobel Prize, mystery novels, thrillers\n\nFacts:\n- Jaroslav Seifert was born on 23 September 1901 and died on 10 January 1986.\n- Jaroslav Seifert was a Czechoslovak writer, poet, and journalist.\n- Stanislav Kostka Neumann was a mentor of Jaroslav Seifert, and Jaroslav Seifert dedicated his first book to him.\n- Harlan Coben was born on 4 January 1962.\n- Harlan Coben is an American writer of mystery novels and thrillers.\n- Jaroslav Seifert won a Nobel Prize.",
